{"product_id":"vgod-nicotine-salt-mighty-mint","title":"VGOD Nicotine Salt - Mighty Mint","description":"\u003cp\u003eNot for the faint of heart, VGOD’s Mighty Mint Nic Salt Juice is frequently praised for its smooth yet substantial flavor, making it a perfect choice for those looking for a powerfully clean and invigorating vape. Refreshing, straightforward, and never too sweet, if you’ve been searching for a brawny new e-liquid to make your next ADV, then VGOD’s Mighty Mint Nic Salt Juice just might be a match that was mint to be.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVGOD’s Mighty Mint Nic Salt Juice comes in a 30ml bottle of nicotine salt juice with your choice between a 25mg (2.5%) and 50mg (5.0%) nicotine strength. Not simping for Mighty Mint? Be sure to check out VGOD’s full selection of nicotine salt juices.\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNic Salt Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBrand: VGOD\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor: Mighty Mint Salt Nic\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Size: 30mL\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eBottle Type: Chubby Unicorn Bottle\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cem\u003eVG\/PG: 55\/45\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eFlavor Profile: \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eSuper Mint\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eMade in USA\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eNicotine Type: Salt Nicotine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAvailable Nicotine Levels: 25mg \/ 50mg\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e","brand":"VGOD","offers":[{"title":"25mg","offer_id":41670490914871,"sku":"VGOD - Mighty Mint - 25mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":true},{"title":"50mg","offer_id":41670490947639,"sku":"VGOD - Mighty Mint - 50mg","price":1525.0,"currency_code":"KES","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0